The November 2026 meeting of LRUG will be on *Monday the 9th of November*,
from _6:00pm_ to _8:00pm_ (meeting starts at _6:30pm_).  The venue this
month is provided by [Workforce](https://www.workforce.com/uk/careers)
and is in [their offices][workforce-venue], on Scrutton St in Shoreditch (near
Old St and Liverpool St tube stations, and Shoreditch High St overground
station).  [Full venue and registration details are given
below](#november26registration).

